{
  "an3.84:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.84 ",
  "an3.84:0.2": "9. Samaṇavagga ",
  "an3.84:0.3": "Vajjiputtasutta ",
  "an3.84:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā vesāliyaṁ viharati mahāvane kūṭāgārasālāyaṁ. ",
  "an3.84:1.2": "Atha kho aññataro vajjiputtako bhikkhu yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho so vajjiputtako bhikkhu bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an3.84:1.3": "“sādhikamidaṁ, bhante, diyaḍḍhasikkhāpadasataṁ anvaddhamāsaṁ uddesaṁ āgacchati. ",
  "an3.84:1.4": "Nāhaṁ, bhante, ettha sakkomi sikkhitun”ti. ",
  "an3.84:1.5": "“Sakkhissasi pana tvaṁ, bhikkhu, tīsu sikkhāsu sikkhituṁ—",
  "an3.84:1.6": "adhisīlasikkhāya, adhicittasikkhāya adhipaññāsikkhāyā”ti? ",
  "an3.84:1.7": "“Sakkomahaṁ, bhante, tīsu sikkhāsu sikkhituṁ—",
  "an3.84:1.8": "adhisīlasikkhāya, adhicittasikkhāya, adhipaññāsikkhāyā”ti. ",
  "an3.84:1.9": "“Tasmātiha tvaṁ, bhikkhu, tīsu sikkhāsu sikkhassu—",
  "an3.84:1.10": "adhisīlasikkhāya, adhicittasikkhāya, adhipaññāsikkhāya. ",
  "an3.84:2.1": "Yato kho tvaṁ, bhikkhu, adhisīlampi sikkhissasi, adhicittampi sikkhissasi, adhipaññampi sikkhissasi, tassa tuyhaṁ bhikkhu adhisīlampi sikkhato adhicittampi sikkhato adhipaññampi sikkhato rāgo pahīyissati, doso pahīyissati, moho pahīyissati. ",
  "an3.84:2.2": "So tvaṁ rāgassa pahānā dosassa pahānā mohassa pahānā yaṁ akusalaṁ na taṁ karissasi, ya